---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — FADE STUDIO | Data Protection & Guest Trust"
  description="Read FADE STUDIO"
  currentPage="privacy"
  showPreloader={false}
>
  <main id="mainContent">

    <!-- ==================== HERO ==================== -->
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="page-hero-inner">
        <span class="page-kicker">DATA PROTECTION</span>
        <h1 class="page-hero-title">
          Privacy <span class="italic-serif">Policy.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="page-hero-desc">
          At FADE STUDIO, your privacy is treated with the same meticulous care as your hair. This document explains how we collect, safeguard, and respect your personal information.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==================== SECTION 1: THE FULL POLICY (6+ SECTIONS) ==================== -->
    <section class="content-section" id="privacy-content">
      <div class="legal-container">

        <article class="legal-section-item">
          <h2 class="legal-section-title">01. Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>
            When you schedule an appointment, subscribe to our offers, or submit an inquiry at FADE STUDIO, we collect details necessary to serve you well. This includes your full name, phone number, email address, preferred appointment date and time, and any optional styling notes or hair history you choose to provide.
          </p>
          <p>
            In-studio, our stylists may record notes regarding your clipper guard sizes, hair colour formulas, or specific scalp sensitivities to ensure consistent results across all your future visits.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="legal-section-item">
          <h2 class="legal-section-title">02. How We Use Your Information</h2>
          <p>
            Your information is used strictly to deliver our grooming services. This includes transmitting appointment confirmation SMS messages, reminder notifications 24 hours prior to your scheduled chair time, and verifying your eligibility for seasonal promotions and first-visit vouchers.
          </p>
          <p>
            We do not sell, lease, rent, or trade guest personal information to any third-party marketing companies, advertisers, or corporate brokers.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="legal-section-item">
          <h2 class="legal-section-title">03. Digital Communications & Offers</h2>
          <p>
            If you voluntarily enter your email to claim our 15% first-visit discount or seasonal privileges, we will occasionally send you studio news, new service introductions, and exclusive guest invitations.
          </p>
          <p>
            You retain the right to opt out of promotional communications at any point by clicking the unsubscribe link in any email or by notifying our concierge desk at <a href="mailto:concierge@fadestudio.in" style="color:var(--color-gold); font-weight:600;">concierge@fadestudio.in</a>.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="legal-section-item">
          <h2 class="legal-section-title">04. Data Protection & Security</h2>
          <p>
            We enforce modern technical and organizational safeguards to shield your data against unauthorized access, loss, or disclosure. Our digital appointment registers and online forms communicate over encrypted SSL/TLS channels.
          </p>
          <p>
            Access to client records is restricted strictly to authorized studio receptionists and management staff on a need-to-know basis.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="legal-section-item">
          <h2 class="legal-section-title">05. Cookies & Local Analytics</h2>
          <p>
            Our website uses minimal, functional browser cookies to facilitate session navigation, maintain your preferred booking parameters, and ensure smooth script execution. We do not track you across unrelated third-party websites or deploy aggressive profiling cookies.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="legal-section-item">
          <h2 class="legal-section-title">06. Your Rights & Data Access</h2>
          <p>
            Under applicable Indian data privacy regulations and ethical salon governance, you have the right to request access to the personal data we hold about you, request corrections to out-of-date phone numbers or names, or request complete deletion of your guest profile from our system.
          </p>
          <p>
            For any privacy inquiries or data requests, please write to our Data Officer at <a href="mailto:privacy@fadestudio.in" style="color:var(--color-gold); font-weight:600;">privacy@fadestudio.in</a> or visit our Indiranagar studio in person.
          </p>
        </article>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==================== SECTION 2: COMMITMENT SUMMARY ==================== -->
    <section class="content-section theme-dark" id="privacy-summary">
      <div class="section-header-block">
        <span class="section-kicker">GUEST CONFIDENTIALITY</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">A quiet guarantee of <span class="italic-serif">discretion.</span></h2>
        <p class="section-desc">We respect your private time in our studio chairs, and we respect your private data online.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="steps-grid">
        <div class="step-card" style="background-color: var(--color-charcoal-card); border-color: var(--color-border-dark);">
          <span class="step-num">01</span>
          <h3 class="step-title" style="color:var(--color-ivory);">Zero Spam</h3>
          <p class="step-desc" style="color:#D5D2CB;">We only message you when it matters — confirmations, essential reminders, or offers you explicitly requested.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card" style="background-color: var(--color-charcoal-card); border-color: var(--color-border-dark);">
          <span class="step-num">02</span>
          <h3 class="step-title" style="color:var(--color-ivory);">No Data Selling</h3>
          <p class="step-desc" style="color:#D5D2CB;">Your phone number and styling preferences remain strictly within FADE STUDIO's private records.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card" style="background-color: var(--color-charcoal-card); border-color: var(--color-border-dark);">
          <span class="step-num">03</span>
          <h3 class="step-title" style="color:var(--color-ivory);">Full Control</h3>
          <p class="step-desc" style="color:#D5D2CB;">You can update or purge your contact information anytime by contacting our front desk team.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==================== SECTION 3: CALL TO ACTION ==================== -->
    <section class="booking-cta-strip">
      <div class="cta-left">
        <span class="cta-kicker">SAFE & SECURE RESERVATIONS</span>
        <h2 class="cta-heading">Ready for your <span class="italic-serif">session?</span></h2>
        <p class="cta-desc">Book with complete peace of mind. We look forward to seeing you.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <a href="/book" class="btn btn-gold">Book Appointment</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
